+### Raw OpenSCAD Fallback Blocks
+
+When `Apply Code` encounters valid OpenSCAD syntax that has no structured
+tree equivalent yet, preserve it as a `RawCode` tree block instead of dropping
+or rejecting it. Raw-code cards should regenerate the original snippet and use
+a scrollable multi-line editor. The toolbar should expose this as a compact
+`R` tool.
